le":0,"stats":[62,75,62,41,41,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"225","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,75,62,41,41,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"225","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,75,62,41,41,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"225","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,75,62,41,41,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"225","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,75,62,41,41,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[62,75,62,41,41,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将。吕蒙袭取荆州期间担任潘璋部下，并麦城附近小路生擒了关羽父子。刘备伐吴期间亦与潘璋随陆逊前去对峙，并射伤蜀国大将黄忠，使其不治身亡。后潘璋被关兴所仇杀，马忠带兵围击，并击退了张苞。但后因降将糜芳、傅士仁欲返回蜀国，便趁马忠熟睡时将其杀害，携其首级逃往蜀国。","tc":"吳國武將。呂蒙襲取荊州期間擔任潘璋部下，并麥城附近小路生擒了關羽父子。劉備伐吳期間亦與潘璋隨陸遜前去對峙，并射傷蜀國大將黃忠，使其不治身亡。后潘璋被關興所仇殺，馬忠帶兵圍擊，并擊退了張苞。但后因降將糜芳、傅士仁欲返回蜀國，便趁馬忠熟睡時將其殺害，攜其首級逃往蜀國。","en":"An officer of Wu. He served under Pan Zhang during Lu Meng's seizure of Jing Province and captured Guan Yu and his son along a small path near Maicheng. During Liu Bei's invasion of Wu, he accompanied Pan Zhang under Lu Xun's command and shot and fatally wounded the Shu general Huang Zhong. After Pan Zhang was killed by Guan Xing in revenge, Ma Zhong led troops to encircle and attack, repelling Zhang Bao. Later, the surrendered generals Mi Fang and Fu Shiren, wishing to return to Shu, murdered Ma Zhong in his sleep and fled to Shu with his head.","jp":"呉の武将。呂蒙が荊州を急襲した際、潘璋の部下として従軍し、麦城付近の間道で関羽父子を生け捕りにした。劉備の呉討伐の際も潘璋と共に陸遜に従って対峙し、蜀の大将・黄忠を射て重傷を負わせ、死に至らしめた。後に潘璋が関興に討たれると、馬忠は兵を率いて包囲攻撃し、張苞を撃退した。だがその後、蜀への帰還を目論んだ降将の糜芳と傅士仁により、熟睡中に殺害され、その首級を携えて蜀へ逃亡された。","kr":"오나라의 무장. 여몽이 형주를 기습했을 때 반장의 부하로 참전하여 맥성 부근의 샛길에서 관우 부자를 생포했다. 유비가 오나라를 정벌할 때도 반장과 함께 육손을 따라 맞서 싸웠으며, 촉나라의 대장 황충을 화살로 쏘아 부상을 입혀 끝내 사망에 이르게 했다. 훗날 반장이 원수를 갚으려는 관흥에게 살해당하자, 마충은 군사를 이끌고 포위 공격을 감행해 장포를 격퇴했다. 그러나 이후 촉나라로 돌아가려던 항장 미방과 부사인이 마충이 깊이 잠든 틈을 타 그를 살해하고, 수급을 챙겨 촉나라로 달아났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10141","remark":"","surname":"马","surnameTc":"馬","surnameEn":"Ma","surnameJp":"馬","surnameKr":"마","surnameOther":"","name":"忠","nameTc":"忠","nameEn":"Zhong","nameJp":"忠","nameKr":"충","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"马忠","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"205","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"62","force":"75","wise":"62","politics":"41","charm":"41","will":"